# Optional. Only needed for the real GitHub contribution heatmap on the
# home page. A classic PAT with no special scopes (or a fine-grained token
# with public read access) is enough -- GitHub's GraphQL API requires a
# token even for public data. Without it, the heatmap falls back to a
# deterministic placeholder grid. Copy this file to .env.local and fill it in.
GITHUB_TOKEN=
